        <h1>Mission <b>Statement</b></h1>

    <div class="row">
        <div class="column text">
         <p>This project aims to develop a program that securely stores and manages medication information for users. It supports account creation and login with clear error handling, ensuring that user data is accurate and protected through enforced password requirements and validation.
        <br><br>
         The system connects patients with providers, allowing for the organization of medication records, the addition of new prescriptions, and the tracking of adherence. By structuring information within a SQL database and guiding users through intuitive patient and practitioner portals, the program focuses on making medication management straightforward, reliable, and easy to navigate. </p>
